l sectors by fiscal year 2030.","quote":"Incremental financing of Rs. 60,000 Crores under Wholesale Banking to sectors with positive social and environmental outcomes, by FY 2030","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/AXISBANK1_18072026132045_IRRevisedSigned.pdf","page":49.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"The bank is positioned to take advantage of the active corporate bond market.","quote":"We remain well placed to benefit from a vibrant Corporate Bond market","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/AXISBANK1_18072026132045_IRRevisedSigned.pdf","page":33.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"pricing","statement":"Invoicemart has facilitated price discovery for MSMEs across more than 1,100 Indian locations to discount bills.","quote":"Invoicemart has helped in price discovery for MSMEs across 1,100+ locations in India who are now able to get their bills discounted from 74 financiers","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/AXISBANK1_18072026132045_IRRevisedSigned.pdf","page":58.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"Higher technology and volume-related costs were balanced out by a reduction in statutory expenses.","quote":"Increase in volume linked and technology cost offset by lower statutory expenses","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/AXISBANK1_18072026132045_IRRevisedSigned.pdf","page":13.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"margins","statement":"The bank's net interest income increased by 8% year-over-year, with the net interest margin reaching 3.46%.","quote":"Net Interest Income up 8% YOY, Net Interest Margin (NIM) at 3.46%","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/AXISBANK1_18072026132045_IRRevisedSigned.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"orders","statement":"Axis Capital has a strong pipeline of over 80 marquee mandates across various transac